<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy Loofty — Kaza Living" description="Datenschutzerklärung für die Android-App Loofty – Ballon-Rettung" noindex={false}>
<section class="wrap legal-page" lang="en">
<p class="lang"><a href="/loofty/datenschutz.html" hreflang="de">Deutsch</a></p>
  <h1>Privacy Policy for the app “Loofty”</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated: 5 October 2026</p>

  <h2>1. Controller</h2>
  <p>Attiq Shad<br>Am Schelmengraben 11<br>64720 Michelstadt<br>Germany<br>Email: <a href="mailto:info@kaza-living.de">info@kaza-living.de</a></p>

  <h2>2. In short</h2>
  <p>Loofty does not collect any personal data. There is no sign-up, no advertising, no analytics or tracking, and the app does not send any data to us or to third parties.</p>

  <h2>3. Data stored only on your device</h2>
  <p>To keep your progress, the app stores the following only locally on your device:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Game progress: best heights, collected stars, unlocked balloons, daily mission progress</li>
    <li>Settings: language, controls, difficulty, sound and vibration</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This data never leaves your device and is not accessible to us. You can delete it at any time by uninstalling the app or clearing the app data in Android settings.</p>

  <h2>4. Android device backup</h2>
  <p>If you have enabled Android backup to your Google account, Android may include the locally stored app data in your personal device backup. This backup is performed by Google as part of your device settings; we have no access to it.</p>

  <h2>5. Sensors and permissions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Vibration:</b> for haptic feedback in the game. You can turn it off in the settings.</li>
    <li><b>Motion sensor:</b> only used if you choose the “Tilt + swipe” controls. The device orientation is processed on the device for steering only and is neither stored nor transmitted.</li>
    <li><b>Internet:</b> the permission is present for technical reasons because of the app framework. Loofty does not connect to the internet; the game works fully offline.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Google Play</h2>
  <p>When you download Loofty from Google Play, Google processes data under its own responsibility. Google's privacy policy applies: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</p>

  <h2>7. Children</h2>
  <p>Loofty does not collect personal data from anyone, including children.</p>

  <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
  <p>Because we do not process any personal data about you, we hold no data that we could provide, correct or delete on request. If you have questions about privacy, contact us at the email address above. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority.</p>

  <h2>9. Changes</h2>
  <p>If the app changes in a way that affects how data is handled, we will update this policy. The version published here applies.</p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
